msgctxt "112_Akiyama"
msgid "I've got an idea. Let's use my hundred bil."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Date
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "124_Date"
msgid "...How, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "136_Akiyama"
msgid "It's simple. We haul it up to the roof of the Millennium\\r\nTower, then kick back and wait."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=4
msgctxt "148_Tanimura"
msgid "What, that's it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "160_Akiyama"
msgid "That's it."
msgstr "Ya está."

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Date
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "172_Date"
msgid "Back it up a sec. What's that accomplish?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "184_Akiyama"
msgid "It'll bring all the flies buzzing straight into our web."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "196_Kiryu"
msgid "Flies?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "208_Akiyama"
msgid "Not literally. I'm talking about our enemies."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "220_Tanimura"
msgid "That's kind of a broad term. Who exactly are you thinking is\\r\ngonna show?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "232_Akiyama"
msgid "Not sure. We'll just have to wait and find out."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Date
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "244_Date"
msgid "...Huh? You're not making any sense, man."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "256_Akiyama"
msgid "Just hold on a second. Think about everyone we know who's\\r\nwrapped up in all this. Munakata, Arai-san, Kido-chan, the\\r\nTojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "268_Akiyama"
msgid "All those parties are playing different roles in this little\\r\nperformance... but we still don't know who's the real ringleader."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "280_Akiyama"
msgid "Until we get them all in one place, laying it all on the line... we're just gonna be shooting in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "292_Kiryu"
msgid "So we'll lure them out to find out who's really in charge."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "304_Akiyama"
msgid "Exactly. We tell each party that we're keeping the cash on the roof of the Millennium Tower... and they can come up and make a deal with us if they want a slice of the pie."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "316_Akiyama"
msgid "We play our cards right, they all slam headfirst into each\\r\nother."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=4
msgctxt "328_Tanimura"
msgid "And then they'll duke it out over the money."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "340_Akiyama"
msgid "Yup. Though I don't really care if they fight or not."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "352_Akiyama"
msgid "All that matters is that we figure out who the big bad is."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "364_Akiyama"
msgid "From then on it'll just be a good old-fashioned beatdown."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "376_Kiryu"
msgid "That's my kind of plan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "388_Tanimura"
msgid "That's the what and where settled, then. What about the\\r\nwhen?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "400_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, it's gonna take a while to haul all those stacks up\\r\nthere. And I'm sure all of you have stuff you wanna handle\\r\nbefore we execute the plan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "412_Akiyama"
msgid "How about we go our separate ways for a while, grab some\\r\nfood, hit up a few convenience stores, then meet back here\\r\nwhen we're ready?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
